status GREEN -- glow_run_contract, glow_desk_reach and glow_desk_run all GREEN on metal after the rebuild; tame_style_check and width-check GREEN; stash_record reads unlanded=0 verdict=ok, which closes both cold reds at their one root. No REDS row booked: the pin stands at its bound and nothing of mine is foldable, so the class is cited by stamp.
recommend keep-going -- the round-open stash has now swallowed a finished lap three times in a day and no round open reads its own box back; a reader printing orphans_work by name at the open is one lap, and the card already names it as yours.
